      "rationale": "Hibru i no gat kopula long 'בלק ... מלך למואב'; Tok Pisin i nidim 'em i'."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na Moab i tok long ol olpela man bilong Midian: Na nau, ol man bilong veraun i bai laitim ⟨את⟩ olgeta samting i stap raun long mipela, olsem bulmakau man i laitim ⟨את⟩ gras bilong gaden. Na Balak, pikinini bilong Tsipor, em i king bilong Moab long taim olsem.",
